  "description": "If you have heard of Ragley, you already know the Blue Pig name. From the early days of the ‘hardcore hardtail’ it has pushed the geometry envelope and been loved by anyone who rides for all-out grin-inducing fun.\nThe Blue Pig Race takes the best bits from the standard Blue Pig and gives it another shot of adrenalin.\nThe Race version gets an additional 10mm of travel from a RockShox Lyric RC, slackening out the head angle and making it even more capable on the rough stuff. Other upgrades include an SLX/XT 12-speed groupset and Nukeproof’s Horizon V2 wheelset, now used by their multiple EWS winning race team.\nGet your weight down, spot the turn, keep off the brakes and let it fly. The only limitation here is your bottle.",
